# Credentials. The Google Cloud console offers the OAuth client as a download and
# the browser lands it wherever it lands — once in this directory, where a `git add`
# swept it into a commit. GitHub's push protection caught that one; this is so
# there is no second time.
client_secret*.json
*.pem
*.p12
*.pkcs12
*.key
